<title>UK: Rice carrier bound for Peru after repairs.</title>
<headline>Rice carrier bound for Peru after repairs.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cyprus-registered African Cape has completed repairs at Montevideo and sailed for Callao in Peru with a cargo of rice, Lloyds Shipping Intelligence said.</p>
<p>The 12,665 dwt vessel arrived at Montevideo on December 5 to load a cargo of bagged rice, which was damaged by water after a forepeak bulkhead ruptured.</p>
